Robot Rage 2: Rearmed, its game files and the assets extracted from them belong to
Raketspel AB and Miniclip. None of them are in this repository.

What this license does NOT cover:

- port/web/src/movies/: the original game's Lingo scripts translated to TypeScript.
- port/web/src/{arena,camera,collision,firepit,hud,parts,robot,sound}.ts: the first
  arena demo, also translated from the original's scripts and data.
- Excerpts of the original game's scripts, data and text quoted elsewhere (in docs/,
  comments and test fixtures).

These are derived from Raketspel AB's and Miniclip's work and remain theirs.

- patches/dirplayer.patch modifies dirplayer-rs and is GPL-3.0-only, as dirplayer-rs
  is. port/extract builds against dirplayer-rs, so a built binary of it is GPL-3.0-only
  too.

